    <statement><p>Which of the following integrals represents the volume of the solid obtained by rotating the region bounded by the curves <m>y=(x-2)^4</m> and <m>8x-y=16</m> about the line <m>x=10?</m></p>
<p><var form="buttons">
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \pi \int_{0}^{\,16} {\left\{\left[10-\left(\frac{1}{8}y+2\right)^2\right]-\left[10-\left(2+\sqrt[4]{y}\right)^2\right]\right\}}\,dy</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \pi \int_{2}^{\,4} {\left\{\left[10-\left(\frac{1}{8}y+2\right)\right]^2-\left[10-\left(2+\sqrt[4]{y}\right)\right]^2\right\}}\,dy</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \pi \int_{0}^{\,16} {\left\{\left[10-\left(\frac{1}{8}y+2\right)\right]-\left[10-\left(2+\sqrt[4]{y}\right)\right]\right\}^2}\,dy</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \pi \int_{2}^{\,4} {\left\{\left[10-\left(\frac{1}{8}y+2\right)\right]-\left[10-\left(2+\sqrt[4]{y}\right)\right]\right\}^2}\,dy</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \pi \int_{0}^{\,16} {\left\{\left[10-\left(\frac{1}{8}y+2\right)\right]^2-\left[10-\left(2+\sqrt[4]{y}\right)\right]^2\right\}}\,dy</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle \pi \int_{2}^{\,4} {\left\{\left[10-\left(\frac{1}{8}y+2\right)^2\right]-\left[10-\left(2+\sqrt[4]{y}\right)^2\right]\right\}}\,dy</m></p>
</li>
</var></p>
</statement>
